<title>USA: Post Apartments Homes LP issues $125 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Post Apartments Homes LP issues $125 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was</p>
<p>priced in two parts on Tuesday, according lead manager Merrill</p>
<p>Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER POST APARTMENTS HOMES LP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 10/01/03</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 99.642  PAY DATE 03/30/97 LAST MOODY BAA1    YIELD 7.361 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 71 BP</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER THE 5.75 PCT U.S. TREASURY DUE 08/2003</p>
<p>BORROWER POST APARTMENTS HOMES LP</p>
<p>AMT $25 MLN	  COUPON 7.50 PCT   MATURITY 10/01/06</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 99.694  PAY DATE 03/30/97 LAST MOODY BAA1    YIELD 7.544 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 83 BP</p>
<p>CALLABLE BOTH ISSUES MAKE-WHOLE AT PAR OR TREASURY PLUS 25 BP</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
